{"ref":"BDB, אַדְמוֹנִי","hw":"אַדְמוֹנִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְמוֹנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. red, ruddy</strong>, of Esau as newborn babe <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a> (whence name Edom acco. to E? cf. Di); of youth <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.12\">1 S 16:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:42\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.42\">17:42</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אַדְמֹנִי)</span>.","next":"BDB, אֲדֻמִּים","prev":"BDB, אֲדַמִדָּם"}